                    </h3>
                    <p className="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-center mb-6 group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors duration-300">
                      Create tasks, set priorities, add due dates, and organize into projects.
                    </p>

                    <div className="bg-pink-500/10 rounded-xl p-4 border border-pink-500/20 group-hover:bg-pink-500/20 transition-colors duration-300">
                      <div className="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div className="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                          <span className="text-white text-xs font-bold">!</span>
